    {
      "id": "u_fb61bcd4827defd17c5905f4_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To avoid cases in which the import is fundamentally broken (e.g. an expired sign-in), the import will error out if it fails to import 6 pages in a row.",
      "sourceHash": "fb61bcd4827defd17c5905f43904861c059018c757ddde9784d5f8820d23ae6d",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Error management and reporting",
      "contextHash": "ae9c96c68311a7b74014c6a30a4d6c8991067c5fa5c945bde80175d25b5bba3a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_e881932b4da48847c9329dd9_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Attributes__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "e881932b4da48847c9329dd9c1d39beb71faeb415abbf4b4a34b167a9078cef7",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Attributes",
      "contextHash": "78927495704395812c12dd084f9dcfac56e8fbcd9e3647b353773f09232d1a5a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ff103f8bf4f2354458d1f90b_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "Pages imported from OneNote have a few built-in __TRILIUM_PH_0__labels__TRILIUM_PH_1__:",
      "sourceHash": "ff103f8bf4f2354458d1f90b9c5aee4b498619dd0458606a65f85777979bab61",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Attributes",
      "contextHash": "78927495704395812c12dd084f9dcfac56e8fbcd9e3647b353773f09232d1a5a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_d9af53aa69781cb0a4854313_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__, with the corresponding page ID in OneNote. This can be used to identify the original OneNote page. Trilium doesn't use it in any way at this moment.",
      "sourceHash": "d9af53aa69781cb0a4854313ca7b1ca158ebf1a51085bf06f30eaf39d085a2e7",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Attributes",
      "contextHash": "78927495704395812c12dd084f9dcfac56e8fbcd9e3647b353773f09232d1a5a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_cd71f03cd148fd211f47007f_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "__TRILIUM_PH_0__ attached to notes that couldn't be imported. This can be used to quickly __TRILIUM_PH_1__Search__TRILIUM_PH_2__ for failed notes.",
      "sourceHash": "cd71f03cd148fd211f47007f83b50f23c39ad1057fb18eda24c689be3123aeb2",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Attributes",
      "contextHash": "78927495704395812c12dd084f9dcfac56e8fbcd9e3647b353773f09232d1a5a",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3f_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "2d166eed4e46d147ae179d3feba2dbd0d28887b22a99884dc255c7ff2e43988d",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations",
      "contextHash": "7d93604ac65d892757fa16639d21ff07a03121d4219781c81fa88101a0e10539",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_af6ba2891366b6b5d4553f36_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Regarding OneNote's freehand structure__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "af6ba2891366b6b5d4553f36b10b2ba0c861126b55d9dcb3ec51bfff1e5d2a38",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Regarding OneNote's freehand structure",
      "contextHash": "27199b94e02ee2b738c4142b7ac6d5e047ac46df5d5a446f428499b1b2417e11",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_769997dd89a3b86402d44636_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "OneNote is fundamentally different to Trilium in structure because it allows freehand drawing to coexist with text, and text boxes can be placed anywhere in the document (e.g. a common use case is to have columns). Trilium has a document flow mechanism for __TRILIUM_PH_0__Text__TRILIUM_PH_1__ notes which means that it can't be freely positioned.",
      "sourceHash": "769997dd89a3b86402d446365d0e742f4747a5d08c5beff39977d9f684ecf90c",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Regarding OneNote's freehand structure",
      "contextHash": "27199b94e02ee2b738c4142b7ac6d5e047ac46df5d5a446f428499b1b2417e11",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c081000b95f5b8d50618e292_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To cope with this difference, Trilium will flatten the text structure into normal paragraphs. The paragraphs will be ordered visually based on the original position of the text boxes, but their horizontal position will not be preserved. Parallel text such as columns may appear interleaved which can cause problems.",
      "sourceHash": "c081000b95f5b8d50618e2921148cc3034e2c93ec084f02a9e0656be14f42579",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Regarding OneNote's freehand structure",
      "contextHash": "27199b94e02ee2b738c4142b7ac6d5e047ac46df5d5a446f428499b1b2417e11",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7c8b9c45e60a8f4cf437c844_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "In addition, drawing in OneNote can be interleaved with text boxes. Text notes in Trilium do not allow for this feature, so all drawing will appear at the end. For some use cases (diagrams, for example) this will work fine, but if you have highlights or other text-dependent drawings they will appear out of order.",
      "sourceHash": "7c8b9c45e60a8f4cf437c844561641531bf3bcac4f7bc48b8122648bd3865819",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Regarding OneNote's freehand structure",
      "contextHash": "27199b94e02ee2b738c4142b7ac6d5e047ac46df5d5a446f428499b1b2417e11",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_c97a9a8b0adcf443aaeeaf05_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "There are plans to support drawing-heavy notes that interleave with text boxes by converting them to a __TRILIUM_PH_0__Canvas__TRILIUM_PH_1__ instead.",
      "sourceHash": "c97a9a8b0adcf443aaeeaf059873e7ebf294bf1bd00df3d91f6a3328c850ce84",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Regarding OneNote's freehand structure",
      "contextHash": "27199b94e02ee2b738c4142b7ac6d5e047ac46df5d5a446f428499b1b2417e11",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_7f869534427175136ef396f0_0",
      "kind": "h3",
      "source": "Password-protected sections__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "7f869534427175136ef396f039fa971757ae65b06370b5c466c32a419a4951e0",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Password-protected sections",
      "contextHash": "0aeba44f2fa33393868a5e7601fd9c71f1c5e2e8c56486ac8fbab84bb164a801",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_b6f902102b6e6edcce9de5c7_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "OneNote supports encryption at section level; when importing a notebook that contains these password-protection sections, Trilium will not be able to read the content of password-protected sections so they will appear empty. This is not a limitation of Trilium, the information is simply not available from the source (Graph API).",
      "sourceHash": "b6f902102b6e6edcce9de5c7e9e49aa1a0018287160bfc8fe8e52fcab1f42db8",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Password-protected sections",
      "contextHash": "0aeba44f2fa33393868a5e7601fd9c71f1c5e2e8c56486ac8fbab84bb164a801",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_0a359a1b6b0e388e3781173c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The section itself is kept for reference and all the sections that could not be imported will be shown in the report (the top-level note called __TRILIUM_PH_0__OneNote import__TRILIUM_PH_1__).",
      "sourceHash": "0a359a1b6b0e388e3781173c115df566e71046b8b9a2a1ee5a21645cccb04f33",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Password-protected sections",
      "contextHash": "0aeba44f2fa33393868a5e7601fd9c71f1c5e2e8c56486ac8fbab84bb164a801",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_93c4d818c5e60dd733aaa058_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "To unprotect a section in OneNote Desktop, right click on the protected section → __TRILIUM_PH_0__Password Protect This Section__TRILIUM_PH_1__ and press __TRILIUM_PH_2__Remove Password__TRILIUM_PH_3__ and sync. Then re-import either only the protected sections or remove everything and start the import from scratch.",
      "sourceHash": "93c4d818c5e60dd733aaa0580e1c5e66dfe64316cd8dd0145b67e3448a78dd8a",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Limitations > Password-protected sections",
      "contextHash": "0aeba44f2fa33393868a5e7601fd9c71f1c5e2e8c56486ac8fbab84bb164a801",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_ed121bb39d77569b1ec76f75_0",
      "kind": "h2",
      "source": "Other limitations__TRILIUM_PH_0__",
      "sourceHash": "ed121bb39d77569b1ec76f75d2d77b8e35f77f65f179fe8ad49e7369c2f8b1f7",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Other limitations",
      "contextHash": "8feee90a83f9368674acb073f6d3cea3821355e4cd054e4ee3564318d90bbbe1",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_a35a0a2b7a0c4653ff6f1a9c_0",
      "kind": "p",
      "source": "The following are known limitations due to how the information comes from the import (Microsoft Graph API), which means that they cannot be fixed.",
      "sourceHash": "a35a0a2b7a0c4653ff6f1a9c979915a126275ea3fd0a6765b75099e5b60ca6bd",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Other limitations",
      "contextHash": "8feee90a83f9368674acb073f6d3cea3821355e4cd054e4ee3564318d90bbbe1",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_f269d1fa0884ea45be3c2dda_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "The order of the sections (and section groups) is not available, the sections are ordered by creation date instead.",
      "sourceHash": "f269d1fa0884ea45be3c2dda551f70a21c45a8086b2e92c5aeb4cc23c3b1aebe",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Other limitations",
      "contextHash": "8feee90a83f9368674acb073f6d3cea3821355e4cd054e4ee3564318d90bbbe1",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_787466085ff9fb586cc64abc_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Revision history.",
      "sourceHash": "787466085ff9fb586cc64abc4310051f875497f7558823d5577a9b566464e252",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Other limitations",
      "contextHash": "8feee90a83f9368674acb073f6d3cea3821355e4cd054e4ee3564318d90bbbe1",
      "status": "pending",
      "active": true
    },
    {
      "id": "u_936d2f47dd9638cd32295dcf_0",
      "kind": "li",
      "source": "Paragraph indentation, as well as code block indentation.",
      "sourceHash": "936d2f47dd9638cd32295dcfe43af9aa464afa414e701653d4e0755e46b2372f",
      "context": "Microsoft OneNote > Other limitations",
      "contextHash": "8feee90a83f9368674acb073f6d3cea3821355e4cd054e4ee3564318d90bbbe1",
      "status": "pending",
